["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/performedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Every `from` Action, or Relationship of type hasInstall or hasUninstall, is performed by `to` Agent.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
